<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>achievement-caretaker</id>
    <version>@VERSION@</version>
    <title>Achievement Caretaker</title>
    <authors>Yaroslav V Tatarenko</authors>
    <owners>Yaroslav V Tatarenko</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yartat/AchievementCaretaker@0c0fd1fb9cbfad729ed4a8547caaa77af098a436/packaging/chocolatey/icon.png</iconUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/tree/main/packaging/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/blob/main/README.md</docsUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/blob/main/LICENSE.txt</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Yaroslav V Tatarenko</copyright>
    <tags>steam achievements achievement statistics gog epic epicgames ubisoft ubisoft-connect games library gaming portable</tags>
    <summary>View and edit achievements and statistics for Steam, and view the libraries and achievements of Epic Games, GOG and Ubisoft Connect.</summary>
    <description>Achievement Caretaker is a portable desktop tool for the achievements and statistics of your games, from one window.

* **Steam**: your library with a completion meter per game, and an editor to unlock, lock and reset achievements and to edit statistics. Steam must be running and you must be logged in; the library opens without it and shows the games saved last time.
* **GOG**: your library and achievements; achievements can be unlocked and locked.
* **Epic Games**: your library and achievements (read-only).
* **Ubisoft Connect**: your library and achievements, read from the files the launcher keeps on your computer, or from Ubisoft if you sign in; with a sign-in an achievement can be unlocked (not locked again).

You sign in to GOG, Epic and Ubisoft on the store's own page, inside the application; Caretaker never sees your password. Sign-in tokens are encrypted for your Windows user. This package installs the portable build (64-bit or 32-bit) and adds a Start menu shortcut; your settings and saved libraries live in your user profile (.sac) and are not removed when you uninstall.

Based on Steam Achievement Manager by Rick (gibbed), distributed under the zlib license, on GOG Achievements Manager by Timendum, and on UbiSlot by BalTor02, Achievements by PSerban93, galaxy-integration-uplay by melcom and UplayKit by UplayDB (all MIT). See the project's README for the full attribution.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/releases/tag/v@VERSION@</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
